}

docs {
  # Delete Capacity Building Evaluation
  
  Permanently deletes a capacity building programme evaluation record by its unique identifier. The corresponding cache entry is also invalidated.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `delete` permission.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                                          |
  |-----------|--------|----------|------------------------------------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the capacity building evaluation to delete   |
  
  ## Validation
  - `id` must be a valid UUID.
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns a success message confirming deletion.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": null,
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  The cache key `cedarrise:capacity:evaluation:<id>` is also deleted.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                             |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID).              |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.                 |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | Authenticated user lacks `delete` permission.            |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                 |
}
